{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35886","headline":"送河南韦主簿归京 · 李咸用","name":"送河南韦主簿归京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岩风爱日泪阑干，去住情途各万端。\n世乱敢言离别易，时清犹道路行难。\n舟维晚雨湘川暗，袖拂晴岚岘首寒。\n见说满朝亲友在，肯教憔悴出长安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35886.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35886","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}